config MTK_YFT_TINY2C_USB
	tristate "YFT tiny-I2C USB accessory detector (Ulefone GQ5012BF1)"
	depends on I2C
	help
	  YFT tiny-I2C USB accessory detection driver used on the Ulefone
	  GQ5012BF1 (uses the yft_usb_flag registry). Source reconstructed by
	  LieppOS from the stock vendor_dlkm module yft_tiny2c_usb.ko.
